@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam shadowing false
actor "Web user" as User
participant "Vue UI / SearchClient" as UI
participant "Crow WebSocket route" as Route
participant SearchSocketService as Service
participant "Own ThreadPool" as Pool
participant SearchPipeline as Pipeline
participant OllamaClient as LLM
participant SearchEngine as Engine
User -> UI : submit query
UI -> Route : connect /ws/search; send {query}
Route -> Service : OnMessage(connection, message)
Service -> Service : validate; enqueue in session FIFO
Service ->> Pool : Submit task
note over Route
  I/O handler returns without waiting for LLM.
end note
Pool -> Pipeline : Run(snapshot, query, observer)
Pipeline -> LLM : ExpandQuery (bounded; fallback on failure)
LLM --> Pipeline : expanded terms or empty list
Pipeline -> Service : observer.on_expansion
Service ->> UI : {stage: query_expansion, data: ...}
Pipeline -> Engine : Search(index, effective query)
Engine --> Pipeline : results
Pipeline -> Service : observer.on_results
Service ->> UI : {stage: keyword_search, data: ...}
Service ->> UI : {stage: done}
UI --> User : stages and results
note over Service
  Bounded queues; FIFO per connection.
  Closed connections suppress further sends.
end note
@enduml
